+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// OCTAVOX native core -- VST3 wrapper BUILD CONFIGURATION (R18-WDB)
+// ============================================================================
+// PROVENANCE: our own independent harmonizer implementation around the
+// octavox native DSP core. NOT a reproduction of the original Eventide
